  "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nWe are trying to use web bluetooth implementation on Samsung Tablet S6 Lite (Google Chrome browser), and we faced an issue when we are using function watchAdvertisement ( or using scanning function from chrome://bluetooth-internals/#devices ) for more then 2 minutes, chrome browser become slower and slower and after 10 and maybe 15 minutes it crashes. (It could be checked by clicking 3 dots to open Settings Menu, it takes sometimes from 10 to even one minute when. this functionality is running for couple of minutes).\r\n\r\nDo you know maybe what could be the problem? On PC this problem doesn't exist, so it could be related to android implementation of chrome browser?\r\n\r\nThanks for you support",
